ROST) Telling Investors With UBS's Upgrade?","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNaHNYQk5vT3JmRXlHTmZJVC1VV0V1OHRKQXBJYUk1YUdyQ0x0bXI4N1pOMGlaa1JuMkNnek1ZekdPSWFpbks4SnoyMGJHcG1VcldQbTZKZE9BM2ZiaWhkS1dlaEQwd0J1SWtaMkp6aXgzSWtFVklfcFdYeVcwSG1tbGdkRHFiOFJvZUxyRk9kSTZNZjdiV3BQQUQwREE4elRK?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"瑞銀升級羅斯商店 (ROST) 告訴投資者什麼？"},{"title":"Ross Stores (ROST) Near $234, Where Does Fair Value Sit?","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNWmp4ZW9VVDhSYmpQVjVETkhNNXh2YjhrSzdBdlZtSml2TWs3RktWSW9VMkdreFdjaFgtSlpFWERkR3NEQ0NGU25hQWd0QWpOcDB4anNzR1BBc21TWFhObWpHU1gwQnJCV3c2bUwyMVFnR2NLWTdiUWRvMDUtRDhfdlJLVHBoVGVFVjRBQ3BGRTRDUjdr?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"Ross Stores (ROST) 接近 234 美元，公允價值在哪裡？"}],"themes":[{"name":"分析師評等","count":6},{"name":"財報","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-31","period":"2026-01-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/745732/000074573226000006/rost-20260131.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Ross Stores, Inc. and its subsidiaries (\"we\", \"our\", or the \"Company\") operate two brands of off-price retail apparel and home fashion stores—Ross Dress for Less (\"Ross\") and dd's DISCOUNTS .","zh":"Ross Stores, Inc. 及其子公司（「我們」、「我們的」或「公司」）經營兩個品牌的折扣零售服裝和家居時尚商店 — Ross Dress for Less（「Ross」）和 dd's DISCOUNTS 。"},{"en":"Ross is the largest off-price apparel and home fashion chain in the United States, with 1,904 locations in 44 states, the District of Columbia, Guam, and Puerto Rico as of January 31, 2026. Ross offers first-quality, in-season, brand name and designer apparel, accessories, footwear, and home fashions for the entire family at savings of 20% to 60% off department and specialty store regular prices every day. Ross' target customers are primarily from middle income households.","zh":"截至 2026 年 1 月 31 日，Ross 是美國最大的折扣服飾和家居時尚連鎖店，在 44 個州、哥倫比亞特區、關島和波多黎各設有 1,904 家門市。 Ross 每天為全家人提供優質、當季、品牌和設計師服裝、配件、鞋類和家居時尚，每天比百貨公司和專賣店正常價格優惠 20% 至 60%。羅斯的目標客戶主要來自中等收入家庭。"},{"en":"We also operate 363 dd's DISCOUNTS stores in 22 states as of January 31, 2026. dd's DISCOUNTS features more moderately-priced first-quality, in-season apparel, accessories, footwear, and home fashions for the entire family at savings of 20% to 70% off moderate department and discount store regular prices every day. The typical dd's DISCOUNTS store is located in an established shopping center in a densely populated urban or suburban neighborhood, and its target customers typically come from households with lower to more moderate incomes.","zh":"截至 2026 年 1 月 31 日，我們還在 22 個州經營 363 家 dd's DISCOUNTS 商店。 dd's DISCOUNTS 為整個家庭提供價格更適中的優質當季服裝、配件、鞋類和家居時裝，每天比中等百貨公司和折扣店正常價格節省 20% 至 70%。典型的dd's DISCOUNTS商店位於人口稠密的城市或郊區的成熟購物中心內，其目標客戶通常來自中低收入家庭。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Ross is the largest off-price apparel and home fashion chain in the United States, with 1,904 locations in 44 states, the District of Columbia, Guam, and Puerto Rico as of January 31, 2026. Ross offers first-quality, in-season, brand name and designer apparel, accessories, footwear, and home fashions for the entire family at savings of 20% to 60% off department and specialty store regular prices every day. Ross' target customers are primarily from middle income households.","zh":"截至 2026 年 1 月 31 日，Ross 是美國最大的折扣服飾和家居時尚連鎖店，在 44 個州、哥倫比亞特區、關島和波多黎各設有 1,904 家門市。 Ross 每天為全家人提供優質、當季、品牌和設計師服裝、配件、鞋類和家居時裝，每天比百貨公司和專賣店正常價格優惠 20% 至 60%。羅斯的目標客戶主要來自中等收入家庭。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We believe the principal competitive factors in the off-price retail apparel and home fashion industry are offering significant discounts on brand name merchandise, offering a well-balanced assortment that appeals to our target customers, and consistently providing store environments that are convenient and easy to shop. To execute this concept, we continue to make strategic investments in our organization. We also continue to make improvements to our merchandising systems to strengthen our ability to plan, buy, and allocate product to our stores. We operate in an attractive sector of retail which offers both value and convenience. We believe that we are well-positioned within the off-price retail apparel and home fashion industry to compete based on these factors.","zh":"我們認為，折扣零售服裝和家居時尚產業的主要競爭因素是對品牌商品提供大幅折扣、提供吸引目標客戶的均衡品種以及始終如一地提供方便且易於購物的商店環境。為了執行這一理念，我們繼續對我們的組織進行策略性投資。我們也繼續改進我們的銷售系統，以增強我們計劃、購買和分配產品到商店的能力。我們在一個有吸引力的零售領域開展業務，既提供價值又提供便利。我們相信，基於這些因素，我們在低價零售服裝和家居時尚產業的競爭中處於有利地位。"},{"en":"Nevertheless, the retail apparel and home fashion markets are highly fragmented and competitive. We face a challenging and rapidly changing macroeconomic and retail environment that creates intense competition for our business from online retailers, department stores, specialty stores, discount stores, warehouse stores, other off-price retailers, and manufacturer-owned outlet stores, many of which are units of large national or regional chains that have substantial resources. The retail apparel and home-related businesses may become even more competitive in the future.","zh":"然而，零售服飾和家居時尚市場高度分散且競爭激烈。我們面臨著充滿挑戰和快速變化的宏觀經濟和零售環境，這為我們的業務帶來了來自線上零售商、百貨公司、專賣店、折扣店、倉儲店、其他折扣零售商和製造商直營店的激烈競爭，其中許多是擁有大量資源的大型全國性或地區性連鎖店的單位。未來服飾零售和家居相關業務的競爭可能會更加激烈。"}],"segments":{},"peers":["TJX","DLTR","ORLY","CTAS","BURL"]}}